{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497554-spirit-influnce-above-spirit-rank","id":1497554,"title":"Spirit Influnce above spirit rank","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-19T12:26:00-08:00","id":1497554,"title":"Spirit Influnce above spirit rank","content":"We're playing 1st ed, <br /> <br /> is there any way to increase a spirits influence level above it's rank.<br /> <br /> Could in any way spirit rank 2 have influence 3 (control)<br /> <br /> <br /> ty <br /> <br /> br<br /> salarion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27553-salarion","name":"Salarion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T17:57:55-08:00","id":1497590,"title":"","content":"As far as I recall, First Edition also said that influence rating was capped by Rank \u2026 however there were a lot of stat blocks inconsistent with this (and ghosts didn\u2019t even have Rank).<br /> <br /> In general, no. But things can also be fudged for story reasons, at the Storyteller\u2019s discretion. If I were to raise an influence for higher, I would use Ban of Power - essentially just adding a Ban/Bane appropriate to whatever reason the stat was raised.<br /> <br /> Is there a reason you don\u2019t want to just use a Rank 3 spirit though?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T07:25:42-08:00","id":1497798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seraph Kitty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497554-spirit-influnce-above-spirit-rank?p=1497590#post1497590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there a reason you don\u2019t want to just use a Rank 3 spirit though?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm considering getting a guardian spirit for our vtr 1st ed game. However we agreed that it would be a rank 2 spirit. My top consideration is a blood influence spirit and I like the concept of blood control with a blood sorcerer but a rank 3 spirit might be a bit too much considering it's other stats. <br /> <br /> I also noticed this in stat blocks that why I thought it might be possible in some way somewhere.<br /> <br /> I took ban of power for an extra numina. I could try and run it by the ST and see how it goes. <br /> <br /> ty<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27553-salarion","name":"Salarion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T14:17:06-08:00","id":1497849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seraph Kitty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497554-spirit-influnce-above-spirit-rank?p=1497590#post1497590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As far as I recall, First Edition also said that influence rating was capped by Rank \u2026 however there were a lot of stat blocks inconsistent with this (and ghosts didn\u2019t even have Rank).<br /> <br /> In general, no. But things can also be fudged for story reasons, at the Storyteller\u2019s discretion. If I were to raise an influence for higher, I would use Ban of Power - essentially just adding a Ban/Bane appropriate to whatever reason the stat was raised.<br /> <br /> Is there a reason you don\u2019t want to just use a Rank 3 spirit though?</div> </div> </div> </div>Side question - could you tell me where was Ban of Power listed? I can\u2019t recall exactly where\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member